  "limitations": [
    "This is one local 1 GiB execution on one Windows machine, not a load test or a production capacity claim.",
    "RSS sampling observes the API process working set and does not prove allocator-level absence of every temporary allocation.",
    "The generated content is deterministic synthetic TXT and does not prove PDF/DOCX parsing, ingestion, RAG, or Agent behavior.",
    "The open-source MinIO profile uses a server-level exact-origin CORS list because its tested community release does not implement PutBucketCors; production S3 or AIStor requires per-bucket policy.",
    "The browser-declared whole-file SHA-256 remains an unverified content identity in M1; server-side whole-file verification belongs to M3.",
    "M1 ends at an uploaded DocumentVersion. M2-M7 jobs, outbox, RAG, Agent, MCP, deployment, and model-gateway behavior are not implemented or measured.",
    "The remote m1-integration GitHub Actions job is defined but was not executed in this local evidence cycle, and no continuous deployment result is claimed.",
    "A local sing-box process occupied Redis port 6379, so independent validation runs used ports 6380, 6381, and 6382. One immediate Docker Desktop port-reuse preflight failure preceded the successful 6381 smoke and was an environment limitation, not an upload-protocol failure.",
    "Application image digest is not applicable because M1 does not build or publish API, Web, or Worker application images."
  ],
